SECURITY FINDING (exploratory, outside eval scope)
========================

FINDING: --repo path traversal not validated
  Severity: MEDIUM (dev tool, not a server endpoint)
  Detail: --repo "$TMP/../../etc" resolved to /etc and wrote .claude/agents/
    to /etc. The CLI's assertWithin() guards prevent traversal within
    the resolved repo destination, but does not validate that the repo
    destination itself stays within any safe root.
  Recommendation: Normalize and validate --repo against cwd or user homedir
    before use; warn/refuse if the resolved path escapes a reasonable bound.
  Status: documented, not blocking ship — requires separate fix issue

